<title>ARGENTINA: Telecom Argentina to redeem $200 mln bonds early.</title>
<headline>Telecom Argentina to redeem $200 mln bonds early.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Argentina SA said Friday it will redeem $200 million of nine percent negotiable bonds early for tax reasons.</p>
<p>The redemption will take place May 22, rather than the due date of August 4, 1997, it said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The bonds, which carry a call option, are mainly held overseas, said Telecom.</p>
<p>Telecom Argentina has talked to its legal advisors abroad who said there are no impediments to the early redemption of the outstanding amount of bonds.</p>
<p>((-- Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
